WEBVTT

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.470
Franca! How's it going over there?

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.240
Fine, I'm just about done.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.230
Okay, it's opening!

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:13.270
We did it!

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.010
Where are we going now?

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.310
To the Graceland gate.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.120
Huh? Are you sure it's okay to
go there without asking?

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.850
If Mister wants to go to Graceland, then there's
no doubt he's got to go through that gate.

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.550
Well, even a kid could figure out that much.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.620
The gate's opened! Now move!

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.590
Boss! We've got trouble!

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:35.530
We've got Guild fighters on our tail!

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.640
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.670
There's no way we'll be able to
hook up with you like this!

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:42.500
If I slow down, we're dead.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.730
What now?

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.090
I'm out!

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:00.390
Where's this?

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:02.410
Bishop! At two o'clock!

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.760
Those bastards have opened fire?

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:22.880
Send out the Guild Skies.

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.500
Yes, Mother.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.910
Guild Skies: Move out!

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:30.780
All right, now it's your turn, my daughters.

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:34.050
Yes, Mother.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:00.150
I etch out today with my finger

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:03.550
on the dusty hood of a car

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:07.020
As the rain shower passed over

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:09.860
it vanished just like love

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:17.100
There's something in your heart you can't get rid of

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:23.200
So beat your invisible wings

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.540
We'll fight back against the wind

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.480
that gusts at us so relentlessly

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.800
We'll stand firm against it

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:37.720
with steadfast emotion! Go!

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:44.630
We continue running on our way

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:50.630
to a place promised, where sandstorms whirl

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:53.760
Tonight is the night

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:57.270
We're gonna make it through

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:04.990
On to our destination!

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:17.260
Episode 6  Fierce Fight

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:29.340
Here they come.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:31.140
What do we do now, Mister?!

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.110
I already told you.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.980
If you're noticed, then break through on your own!

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:57.030
What was that sound just now?

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.010
It's Mother and the others.

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:01.560
Huh?

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.770
Mister!

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:09.710
Please wait up!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.370
Katana! We're hooking up with you!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.740
Where are you now?

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:36.200
Where am I?

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.200
C'mon, gimme a minute!

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:47.350
Swamp, are you ready yet?

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:51.420
Keep your shin on! This is my first time
working one of these things!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.090
Hey, come on now. What am I supposed to do?

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:20.420
We will now go in pursuit of the Coyotes.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.080
We'll split into two teams.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:29.550
March, June, August, January,
you four will hunt down their ship.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.270
I will go after Mister.

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:35.360
January!

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:42.130
I am going to avenge Sep!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:46.770
Move out!

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.510
We're going to crash!

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:07.920
Bishop! Katana! Do you read me?!

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.130
<i>...can't... you too well... ster!</i>

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:11.930
<i>What... Wh... ...ay you are?</i>

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.200
Damn!

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.280
Mister!

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.820
Wait, Angelica!

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:00.950
Respond, Coyote!

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:02.110
<i>Mister!</i>

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:04.620
That you, Katana?

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:06.720
Mister, it's me! It's Katana!

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:09.220
Yeah, I know that. Where are you now?

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:11.730
Where? Well, it's like...

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:12.920
Whoa!

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:27.510
Up, Mister!

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:28.480
I'm heading up to the next level!

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.670
Up?

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:34.550
What do you mean by "up," Katana?

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.020
Bishop!

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:37.490
You made it out alive?

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:38.750
Obviously.

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.760
Now come and get me, quick.

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:42.290
Where are you guys?

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.490
I'll be in the marketplace in a few seconds.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:47.690
Okay! We'll meet up in the marketplace!

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.760
Okay, I'm counting on you.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.990
Thank goodness, everyone's all right.

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:06.610
I found you... Mister!

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:17.960
Take this!

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:28.360
What the...

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.100
Tough luck for you, Mister!

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:40.600
We're ejecting!

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:53.390
Bingo!

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:56.290
The marketplace is in a state of emergency.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:09:00.230
We ask that all customers please
evacuate as quickly as possible.

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.540
I repeat...

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:02.440
Here they come!

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:04.940
Show me the power of Bruce's right-hand man!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.040
I'm just getting back into the swing of
things after a long time out.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:09.810
Have some consideration, will ya?

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:18.120
Lookin' good to me!

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:20.850
Here come reinforcements, Swamp!

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.930
Where are they?

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.330
Such a bother...

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.950
We'll take down the buildings too.

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:37.340
What is that?

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:39.440
Now what are they up to?

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:42.380
Oh, no!

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:44.280
They mean to take us down along
with the buildings!

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:46.440
That's nuts!

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:49.240
April!

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:54.550
Wait. Stand back.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:03.330
A bomb?!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.630
They've provided entertainment for us.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:12.500
That made them even harder to find!

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:15.270
Don't act like you weren't for doing it too.

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:22.620
Not willing to give in, are they?

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:24.990
<i>Coyote! Coyote, do you read?</i>

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.820
Hey, there he is!

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.310
This is the Coyote!

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.490
<i>Hey. Kenna'?</i>

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:33.860
I'm in the marketplace's central plaza right now.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.030
Where are you?

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.900
Holed up in the shadow of a couple buildings.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.700
I'm being stalked by some pretty persistent ladies.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.870
Man, you're making me jealous.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.040
Can you get over here?

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.940
Roger that. I'll see what I can do.

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:52.540
I have finished hacking into all the
surveillance systems.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:57.590
Picking up Coyotes in the central plaza
and section A-3.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.790
They are headed towards the marketplace.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:01.860
Inform April.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.480
Yes, Mother.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:07.920
I'll leave you no place to return to.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.400
Mister is?

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.060
You heard that, right, January?

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:16.830
Of course. I'm heading there now.

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.240
Coyote, can you read me? Coyote!

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:15.190
Mister!

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:19.030
Withdraw, January. It's time.

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:25.870
Do you read me, Mister? I'm here to rescue you.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.340
Just hang on a second, while I bring her down.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:33.940
We were sure in demand up until a minute ago.
Lucky for us, it looks like the tide's going out.

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:47.420
What's wrong, Mister?

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.330
Franca, Katana! Get outta here!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.400
Huh?

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:52.560
Just get the hell away from here!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.500
Fire!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.460
February, prepare my ship.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.020
Yes, Mother.

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:25.330
Mother?

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.890
I want to have a word with Mister.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.080
Franca...

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:42.420
Franca!

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:54.920
Mister!

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:57.870
Franca!

00:13:58.600 --> 00:13:59.790
Mister!

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.440
Franca!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.930
Mister!

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.000
Are you all right?

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:06.600
I'll be right over! Wait there for me!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.170
Okay.

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:28.820
Mister?!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.580
This is as far as you go.

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:46.310
Mister? What's the matter?

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.210
What was that gunshot just now?

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:52.310
The little girl is over there, isn't she?

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:55.210
Franca...

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.920
Mister...

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:20.520
Papa...

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.650
I haven't seen you since then.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:29.350
You look well, and that's what matters most.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.970
I have some business to attend to with your pal.

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:42.770
Where is he?

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:44.670
Is that Marciano?!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:45.920
Mother?

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:49.300
Oh, dear, Mister is over there, isn't he?

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:54.310
Franca! Are you all right?!

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.180
Franca!

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:58.920
I have already incapacitated him.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:01.660
Well done, April.

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:04.290
Don't you lay a hand on Franca!

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:05.660
If you touch her, I'll make sure you never...

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.760
Oh, I won't lay a hand on her at all!

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:15.200
Provided you tell me all about Bruce's legacy.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:18.640
Shall I put another round into him, Mother?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:21.980
No, it would likely serve no purpose.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:24.310
I guess I have no choice then.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:28.110
Though I cannot quite say this is to my taste...

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:30.350
MARCIANO!

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:34.280
Oh, my, I do believe we've been
in a similar situation before.

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:37.830
Mister, if this girl's life means anything to you...

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:40.120
If you'll spare Mister...

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.790
I'll tell you.

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.860
You will?

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:48.540
Will you promise me?

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:49.440
Don't do it!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:52.200
A promise like that coming from her is worthless!

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:58.380
Mister!

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:09.690
This is it.

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:14.250
The secret to Papa's legacy is
hidden inside this pendant.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.320
Franca...

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:22.870
You better keep your promise.

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:26.900
Yes! However, I am going to take you with me too.

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:30.210
Stop it! Let me go!

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:30.980
Let me go!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:31.510
Franca! Marciano, you bitch!
Let me go!

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:34.080
Franca! Marciano, you bitch!
Stop it! No!

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.980
Stop, you friggin...

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.890
What? You mean you aren't going to spare me?

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:46.690
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:50.720
Well, don't you worry. I wasn't expecting it anyway!

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:01.200
Mister!

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:09.200
Mister!

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:17.520
Oh, April, return to the ship.

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.650
Yes, Mother.

00:18:21.930 --> 00:18:23.930
Leave Mister alone.

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:25.930
For a man who has had a dear friend's
legacy stolen from him

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:29.040
and who has also failed to protect
that friend's daughter,

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.670
what is the most difficult thing to deal with?

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.810
Stop right there!

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.780
I'm gonna borrow this for a little bit.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.560
You wait right there, Mister.

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.460
The next one won't miss.

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:05.140
You might as well be going off to die.

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:09.800
I made a promise...

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:15.780
I made a promise that I'd take her to Graceland!

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.850
Would you mind getting out?

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:28.760
Sorry about this.

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:34.160
Coyotes don't run in packs!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.440
But I'll tell ya...

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:41.030
That's exactly why they won't betray their kin,
even if costs them their lives!

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:04.400
Your heart rate and body temperature both rose.

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:07.560
Or in human terms, you were
rather upset, weren't you?

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:10.030
Why didn't you shoot him?

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:14.510
This is the guy you've been after 
for four years now, right?

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.350
Angelica...

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:26.380
<i>Mister? Do you read me, Mister?</i>

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:28.920
Yeah, I read you.

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:29.830
<i>Are you all right?</i>

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:30.320
Yeah!

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:35.430
We got messed up pretty bad here,
but we're making some headway now.

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:37.030
It looks like we'll be able to take off real soon.

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:38.210
That's not it!

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:39.250
I know already!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:42.170
<i>Franca's been taken away by Marciano.</i>

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.160
<i>I swear to God I'm gonna take her back!</i>

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:52.940
What kind of secret is hidden inside this?

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.670
Well, no matter.

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.780
Unidentified object approaching from behind.

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:01.620
Mister!

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:02.570
What?!

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:23.810
Mister!

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:25.540
That was damn reckless of you!

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:28.180
<i>Perfect timing!</i>

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:29.680
Catch 'em, Bishop!

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.010
Okay!

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:37.180
Bishop, Katana! Just take us straight
to the Graceland gate!

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:39.490
All right!

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:47.520
I won't let you get away!

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:54.140
Enemy craft detected ahead of us too.

00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:55.470
Damn it!

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:02.680
What do we do now, Mister?

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:05.250
Mister?

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:08.850
Mister!

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:11.560
Watch out there, Katana!

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:14.830
To the right! Right!

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:16.990
You sure that's the right gate?

00:22:17.460 --> 00:22:19.360
Just get the heck in there!

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:21.590
Fire!

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:27.610
Mister!

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:44.590
<i>Where are these waterdrops...</i>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:54.900
<i>that travel along my cheek coming from?</i>

00:22:54.900 --> 00:22:59.030
<i>Tell me...</i>

00:23:01.350 --> 00:23:12.720
<i>I grabbed the rule that says we can't tum back time</i>

00:23:12.720 --> 00:23:20.130
<i>by the collar</i>

00:23:20.130 --> 00:23:23.860
<i>I resist the fading memories</i>

00:23:23.860 --> 00:23:34.510
<i>even with the feelings here</i>

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:38.010
<i>But I'm sure they'll come to kill me</i>

00:23:38.010 --> 00:23:44.620
<i>From out of all the days that have gone by</i>

00:23:44.620 --> 00:23:53.090
<i>there's only one thing I can believe in</i>

00:23:53.090 --> 00:23:59.430
<i>I cried until my voice was hoarse</i>

00:23:59.430 --> 00:24:02.770
<i>Come to me</i>

00:24:02.770 --> 00:24:06.440
<i>Be by my side</i>

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:10.070
<i>O Kay?</i>
